WEBVTT

00:06:28.838 --> 00:06:31.048
Of course, I'm not sure
they'll be up to it."

00:06:31.072 --> 00:06:33.976
(Laughter)

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.341
All right. So I'm going
to take a piece of Chopin.

00:06:36.365 --> 00:06:38.626
This is a beautiful prelude by Chopin.

00:06:39.198 --> 00:06:40.666
Some of you will know it.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:44.508
(Music)